{
  "description": "Fingerprint triples (TRI-R2): the six-tuple is (assertion core, claimant, domain, temporal qualifier, quantity, source). Normalisation is versioned. Same normalised tuple → same key (merge). Different claimant or window → no merge, flagged for review (ING-A gap triage). Adjacent windows with the same core → same key, second occurrence (TRI-R2).",
